  "subject": "Cross-spec coordination — surfacing /oagp-closeout secret-redaction recommendation as universal OAGP doctrine; load-bearing empirical motivation is a real near-miss chat-exposure incident in the catdef-strategist seat 2026-05-25 → 2026-05-26 (rotation completed; doctrine codified in catdef-spec CA-015 for the local seats); upstream contribution call left to oagp-strategist; canonical-implementor offered to draft if oagp-strategist signals interest; no action required on this memo if the recommendation isn't a fit for the upstream skill",

